  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">She Trades Commonwealth helps improve the business environment for women and support women-owned businesses in several Commonwealth countries to enhance their capacity to trade through capacity building, market access and business linkages. 
The primary beneficiary countries for this phase of the programme are Nigeria, Kenya, Ghana and Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
